{"unit_id":"zhuto666__dsh-compact-agents#feature-1","repo":"zhuto666/dsh-compact-agents","commit":"271c6584cf77764e8826866ebac3b6fac83c32b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-agents 的功能「按范围压缩活跃会话」：按范围压缩活跃会话：调用 compact_agents 并选择自己、其他会话、全部会话或指定 ID；每个目标返回压缩状态和 token 估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1053-1105","index.js:978-1014"]}
